===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*h₁em-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|example}}, {{m|enm|exaumple}}, from {{der|en|fro|example}}, {{m|fro|essaumple}}, from {{der|en|la|exemplum|lit=what is taken out|t=sample, pattern, specimen, copy for imitation, etc.}}; see {{m|en|exempt}}. {{doublet|en|exemplum|sample}}. Displaced native {{ncog|enm|forebisne}}, from {{ncog|ang|forebȳsn}}; and {{ncog|enm|bisne}}, from {{ncog|ang|bȳsn}} (modern {{ncog|en|bizen}}).

